Revision history for EV-Telegram-TDLib

0.03    2026-08-27
        Mini Apps, forum topics, chat and group management, folders,
        contacts, payments, secret chats, bot provisioning, and
        schema validated call()

0.02    2026-08-26
        Entity text slicing, unicode documentation, GTK4/Tickit/MCP examples

0.01    2026-08-22
        Initial release: synchronous td_execute binding, EV-integrated
        asynchronous transport, authorization state machine, and
        convenience layers for users, chats, messages and files.
